    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Try climbing, you looo~ser \u2661&quot;</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ZAKO NO AHIRU&quot; is a high-difficulty 2D platform action game. Aim for the top while being insulted by &quot;mesugaki&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Synopsis</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a strange twist of fate, you find yourself trapped in a game created by &quot;mesugaki&quot; from your neighborhood. Your body has been transformed into a toy duck. While you're in a helpless situation, you can still squirt out water stored in your body with a &quot;pew pew&quot; sound, allowing you to hop to where you want to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...However, this toy body has its quirks and doesn't move quite as you'd expect. In order to return to your original world and to teach a lesson to &quot;mesugaki&quot;, you, as a duck, set out towards the summit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While retaining the entertaining frustration of &quot;rage climbing games&quot; like Getting Over It, this game offers a unique enjoyment in mastering the peculiar movements of a &quot;toy duck&quot;. Moreover, as you play, your skills will be taunted by a character with the &quot;mesugaki&quot; attribute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to reach her while maintaining your composure?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Try climbing, you looo~ser \u2661&quot;</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ZAKO NO AHIRU&quot; is a high-difficulty 2D platform action game. Aim for the top while being insulted by &quot;mesugaki&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Synopsis</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a strange twist of fate, you find yourself trapped in a game created by &quot;mesugaki&quot; from your neighborhood. Your body has been transformed into a toy duck. While you're in a helpless situation, you can still squirt out water stored in your body with a &quot;pew pew&quot; sound, allowing you to hop to where you want to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...However, this toy body has its quirks and doesn't move quite as you'd expect. In order to return to your original world and to teach a lesson to &quot;mesugaki&quot;, you, as a duck, set out towards the summit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While retaining the entertaining frustration of &quot;rage climbing games&quot; like Getting Over It, this game offers a unique enjoyment in mastering the peculiar movements of a &quot;toy duck&quot;. Moreover, as you play, your skills will be taunted by a character with the &quot;mesugaki&quot; attribute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to reach her while maintaining your composure?</p>",
